WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
<v lorcan thornbury>thank you for calling thistle, this call may be recorded.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.067
<v oskar pemberton>hi, yeah, i need to reset my thistle card pin.

00:00:09.267 --> 00:00:12.733
<v lorcan thornbury>i can help. can i get your full name?

00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:15.000
<v oskar pemberton>oskar pemberton.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.533
<v lorcan thornbury>and for verification, your social security number?

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:23.933
<v oskar pemberton>it's nine two seven zero four four one six nine.

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:27.067
<v lorcan thornbury>sorry, could you repeat that?

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:29.067
<v oskar pemberton>927-04-4169.

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:32.533
<v lorcan thornbury>thank you. and your date of birth?

00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:34.533
<v oskar pemberton>3rd of july.

00:00:34.733 --> 00:00:39.267
<v lorcan thornbury>okay. the new card goes to the address in new ardley?

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:49.267
<v oskar pemberton>yes. oh and my number changed, it's eight one zero five seven... let me redo that, eight one zero five five five zero one four four.

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:51.933
<v lorcan thornbury>got it. anything else?

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:59.000
<v oskar pemberton>no, wait, yes, i walked past a thistle on the way here and remembered the branch closed.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.800
<v lorcan thornbury>right, that branch closed last month. have a nice day.
